    <briefdescription>
<para>Vertex of a solid line ribbon, shared with the main thread for pre-built vertex caches. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Packs a data point index, a path corner, a join half, and a ribbon side into four bytes, which the shaders read as normalized bytes (see line_vertex_input.glsl). </para>
